one slave and one day be her king.

258
00:17:34,600 --> 00:17:35,780
I take it back.

259
00:17:36,260 --> 00:17:38,084
He's the one who got corrupted.

260
00:17:40,600 --> 00:17:42,837
But now she's dead.

261
00:17:42,920 --> 00:17:45,320
Murdered by that goddamn punk.

262
00:17:45,700 --> 00:17:50,060
I have to avenge her death,
otherwise she'll never rest in peace.

263
00:17:52,180 --> 00:17:53,517
Someone has to die.

264
00:17:53,600 --> 00:17:54,430
Some one.

265
00:17:54,513 --> 00:17:56,380
Just one person is all.

266
00:18:00,380 --> 00:18:03,060
I'll give her the memorial she deserves.

267
00:18:13,340 --> 00:18:14,620
That's enough.

268
00:18:17,140 --> 00:18:19,460
Stop it. Stop it!

269
00:18:24,400 --> 00:18:25,400
HALT!

270
00:18:42,700 --> 00:18:45,600
I'll get you some help! Just hold on!

271
00:18:59,100 --> 00:19:00,200
I'm sorry.

272
00:19:00,680 --> 00:19:03,380
It's all my fault.

273
00:19:04,340 --> 00:19:05,170
No, Liz.

274
00:19:05,420 --> 00:19:06,317
Don't say that.

275
00:19:06,400 --> 00:19:07,280
It's not.

276
00:19:11,640 --> 00:19:14,077
Tell your people to
lay down their weapons.

277
00:19:14,160 --> 00:19:15,080
They do that.

278
00:19:15,260 --> 00:19:18,080
And I promise not to
kill you or any of them.

279
00:19:18,480 --> 00:19:19,420
We will not!

280
00:19:19,580 --> 00:19:20,960
We do not fear death!

281
00:19:21,100 --> 00:19:22,497
We shall fight you until the last!

282
00:19:22,580 --> 00:19:24,345
Do what he says and surrender!

283
00:19:24,440 --> 00:19:25,280
It's over!

284
00:19:25,480 --> 00:19:27,080
It's not worth dying for!

285
00:19:27,320 --> 00:19:29,320
I know how you feel, believe me!

286
00:19:29,540 --> 00:19:30,716
You have to survive!

287
00:19:31,280 --> 00:19:32,574
That's why we're here!

288
00:19:33,560 --> 00:19:34,390
It's...

289
00:19:34,473 --> 00:19:35,400
it's our only...

290
00:19:43,760 --> 00:19:44,880
We win!

291
00:19:45,580 --> 00:19:46,756
We beat the hackers!

292
00:19:48,100 --> 00:19:48,980
Been a while.

293
00:19:49,520 --> 00:19:50,600
Lightning flash.

294
00:19:58,340 --> 00:20:01,399
Haven't heard anyone use
that handle in a long time.

295
00:20:01,660 --> 00:20:05,180
God, it sure does bring back
some good memories. Revenge.

296
00:20:05,400 --> 00:20:06,400
Is that it?

297
00:20:06,660 --> 00:20:10,760
You want to punish the Assault Team
for destroying Laughing Coffin?

298
00:20:14,280 --> 00:20:16,540
Are you stupid or something?

299
00:20:16,860 --> 00:20:18,360
Try this on for size.

300
00:20:18,720 --> 00:20:23,137
Remember how someone tipped the Assault
Team off about Laughing Coffin's hideout?

301
00:20:23,220 --> 00:20:25,180
Well, that someone was me!

302
00:20:28,960 --> 00:20:31,120
Why would you do that?

303
00:20:31,860 --> 00:20:33,160
To prove a point.

304
00:20:33,420 --> 00:20:36,773
To make you guys into the
cold-blooded murderers we were.

305
00:20:37,100 --> 00:20:38,747
Specifically your boyfriend.

306
00:20:38,900 --> 00:20:42,837
Always acting high and mighty, but in
the end he's just a killer like me.

307
00:20:42,920 --> 00:20:43,800
You're insane.

308
00:20:44,080 --> 00:20:45,357
That's what you wanted?

309
00:20:45,440 --> 00:20:49,860
To make Kirito - To make him
kill someone in SAO? Yup.

310
00:20:50,120 --> 00:20:52,179
That's exactly what I wanted to do.

311
00:20:52,480 --> 00:20:56,177
That day I found myself a hiding place
and watched the whole thing go down.

312
00:20:56,260 --> 00:21:00,880
when the dumbass in black snapped and
chopped down two of my fellow coffins,

313
00:21:00,980 --> 00:21:04,560
and damn near blew my cover
because I was laughing so hard.

314
00:21:05,300 --> 00:21:06,260
You monster!

315
00:21:06,500 --> 00:21:08,417
Do you know the guilt you made him suffer?

316
00:21:08,500 --> 00:21:10,680
How much he still suffers? Really?

317
00:21:11,100 --> 00:21:15,571
Glad to hear I rubbed off on him, but
I doubt he feels that guilty about it.

318
00:21:16,220 --> 00:21:18,455
If he's all torn up like you say, why,

319
00:21:18,620 --> 00:21:22,267
playing VR games would be the
last thing he'd do, but he does.

320
00:21:22,460 --> 00:21:24,754
Maybe killing those guys was no biggie.

321
00:21:25,280 --> 00:21:26,637
Hey, here's an idea.

322
00:21:26,720 --> 00:21:28,740
Your boy's in here, too, isn't he?

323
00:21:31,640 --> 00:21:34,260
Yeah, let's ask him how he feels.

324
00:21:46,840 --> 00:21:48,660
No, don't! Please!

325
00:21:53,300 --> 00:21:56,100
It's SHOWTIME!

326
00:22:49,525 --> 00:22:50,355
Thank you.

327
00:23:39,240 --> 00:23:39,970
I don't know what to do
